<div class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-text">
  <p><strong>One shared project.</strong> Backing supports Gloss’s picture dictionary. Language interests help us prioritise; contributions are not ring-fenced to individual languages.</p>
  <p><strong>A one-off pledge, with a clear reward.</strong> Family rewards include fixed-term access to Nesta, Gloss and future TinyKite apps. Membership starts after the free beta and does not renew automatically.</p>
  <p><strong>Honest progress.</strong> Picture coverage and language expansions are work in progress. We’ll publish what we create, what has passed review and how contributions are spent. A language estimate is not a delivery promise.</p>
  <p><strong>Before payments open.</strong> We will publish delivery estimates, cancellation and refund terms, and how grown-ups claim or gift their membership. No payment is being accepted on this preview.</p>
  <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground"><a class="underline" href={TERMS_PATH}>Gloss terms</a> · <a class="underline" href={BACKER_PRIVACY_PATH}>Backer privacy</a></p>
